# 统一换行规范，避免 Windows/Linux 之间来回改行尾导致整文件 diff
# PowerShell 脚本必须保留 CRLF（PS 5.1 对混合换行会解析出错）
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 其余文本文件入库统一用 LF
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# 二进制/压缩包不做任何转换
*.zip  binary
*.exe  binary
*.ico  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
